    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1719970/extras/4294a02fa1179b135b44f45181a9f203.poster.avif?t=1734018840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1719970/extras/4294a02fa1179b135b44f45181a9f203.webm?t=1734018840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1719970/extras/4294a02fa1179b135b44f45181a9f203.mp4?t=1734018840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MonsterCare is a management-simulation game, where you play as a rookie owner of a wellness resort for monsters! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world of monsters, not unlike our own, is a pretty stressful place, so a lot of them are way overdue for a relaxing getaway, and that\u2019s where you come in! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and manage your dream resort to keep your patrons pleased and help them relax and unwind, all while growing and developing your business!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1719970/extras/4294a02fa1179b135b44f45181a9f203.poster.avif?t=1734018840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1719970/extras/4294a02fa1179b135b44f45181a9f203.webm?t=1734018840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1719970/extras/4294a02fa1179b135b44f45181a9f203.mp4?t=1734018840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MonsterCare is a management-simulation game, where you play as a rookie owner of a wellness resort for monsters! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world of monsters, not unlike our own, is a pretty stressful place, so a lot of them are way overdue for a relaxing getaway, and that\u2019s where you come in! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and manage your dream resort to keep your patrons pleased and help them relax and unwind, all while growing and developing your business!</p>",
    "short_description": "Two Point Hospital meets Spirited Away - play as the manager of a wellness resort for monsters. Try to avoid it spiraling out of control, and help your guests find inner peace!",
